{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
When [Bb]day came he called his disciples near
He [Gm7]chose twelve of them to draw him near
Si[Eb]mon whom he named the [Gm7]Cananaean
Stood with[Eb]in the list of [Fsus4]those chosen
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Eb]Gave them power [F]over all [Gm]demons there
