{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
In the upper room they gathered close
With one mind they devoted [Gm]themselves to prayer
Peter John and [Eb]James and Andrew
Philip Thomas [Bb]Bartholomew and [Fsus4]more [F]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
